  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV&amp;AIDS transitional programme 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A one-year project of transitional support to CDD&apos;s HIV&amp;AIDS programme, directed at two main outcomes:
1. Continuation of existing support to FSW in Dili, to reduce isolation and stigma, and to develop alternative livelihood options.
2. Capacity-building measures to improve the knowledge and skills of CDD management and staff, to enable them to develop and manage an HIV&amp;AIDS programme suitable for their target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
